Device: ELAN ARM-M4 (USB 04f3:0c77)
Device ID(s): 04f3:0c77

Status: community patch, not upstream

Patch, package build and protocol notes: inumineq (@inumineq)
  https://github.com/inumineq/libfprint-elan-0c77

The driver is Davide Depau's elanmoc2 driver, ported to current upstream
libfprint and adjusted for this sensor:
  https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/Depau/libfprint (branch elanmoc2, commit 11f0316d)
  https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/libfprint/libfprint/-/merge_requests/330
  https://github.com/depau/elanpoc

The first report that 04f3:0c77 speaks this protocol:
  https://github.com/depau/elanpoc/issues/2

The 15 enroll samples follow Prashant Adhikari's driver for 04f3:0c6c:
  https://github.com/ITx-prash/libfprint-elan-04f3-0c6c

Part of libfprint (LGPL-2.1).
